SLH-DSA-SHAKE-128s (FIPS 205) — vendored implementation

Source:   https://github.com/pq-code-package/slhdsa-c
Commit:   174c02e42257f95c210963272877c49dbb50070f
License:  Apache-2.0, MIT or ISC, see LICENSE. All allow commercial use
          and sale. We take it under Apache-2.0, matching the repository.

Files copied unchanged except:
  sha3_api.h     its Keccak/SHA-3 symbols are renamed with a zxv_slh_
                 prefix so they cannot collide with src/mlkem/keccak.c.
Not copied: the SHA-2 parameter sets (slh_sha2.c, sha2_256.c, sha2_512.c),
pre-hash support (slh_prehash.*), tests, proofs and build files. sha2_api.h
stays because slh_var.h declares its types.

Glue: ../pq_slhdsa.c. Checked against NIST ACVP vectors: ../test_pq_kat.c.
